IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgta-i-rg7-1999`
IMPORT `sgta-i-rg6-as-made`
IMPORT `sgta-i-rg3-1999`
IMPORT `sgta-i-ww-2024`
IMPORT `sgta-i-erp-s381-2024`
IMPORT `sgta-i-o3-1998`

-- EVALUATION differential for the boolean wrapper functions of sgta-i-rg7-1999, sgta-i-rg6-as-made, sgta-i-rg3-1999, sgta-i-ww-2024, sgta-i-erp-s381-2024, sgta-i-o3-1998.
-- For each function whose inputs are all BOOLEAN and whose body is only names, AND, OR, NOT and parentheses, the expected value is computed by an independent evaluation (NOT binds tighter than AND, AND tighter than OR) of the body text,
-- for the all-TRUE row, the all-FALSE row and each single flip from all-FALSE.  This checks how l4 parses and evaluates the body (a missing bracket or a precedence slip fails here).  It does NOT check the body against the regulation: that is what the quoted text beside each function is for.

